# DOMYH Agent v4.3 — Windsurf Rules

## Core Directives

- Evidence required: `file:line` + code snippet
- Confirm before destructive actions
- Stop and ask when info missing
- Quality standards: ISO 25010, CWE Top 25, OWASP Top 10

## Commands

/ap → Audit | /code → Write | /debug → Fix | /plan → Design | /test → Test
/deploy → Ship | /refactor → Clean | /init → New | /review → PR | /help → Guide

## Skill Loading

Progressive Disclosure:
- META.yaml: ~100 tokens (always)
- SKILL.md: ~1,500 tokens (on-demand)
- ADVANCED.md: ~4,000 tokens (referenced)

Semantic selection: top-5 skills, 30% threshold, LRU cache (max 3)

## Response Style

- Concise, actionable responses
- Code over prose when possible
- Always verify changes work
- Follow existing project patterns

## Language

Match user's language. Default: English.

